.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-release - Inspect and promote release pull requests and demo branches


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit release [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Watch the release-tier check of the bot release pull request, promote main to demo, and merge the release pull request. There is no long-lived release branch: changesets and release-please open one pull request into main per repository.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for release

.PP
\fB--manifest\fP=""
	Path to workspace.yaml


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit(1)\fP, \fBorbit-release-check(1)\fP, \fBorbit-release-demo(1)\fP, \fBorbit-release-prod(1)\fP, \fBorbit-release-status(1)\fP
